    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "we checked the pressure and it seems even across the plate, and the fabric is taut. but the spots are really weird—sometimes they look like they just disappeared or didn't take at all, even in the middle of a solid color block. it's like the ink just isn't showing up where it should. could it be a problem with the sublimation paper or the ink chemistry itself?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
