    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "we swapped the paper batch and it didn't change anything. the same weird, patchy gaps keep appearing. it's actually getting kind of frustrating because it feels almost intentional, like the ink is just choosing not to land in certain spots. is there any way the heat could be causing certain parts of the ink to just vanish during the transfer?",
